{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>好消息！今年係Pokémon 30週年，係如此重要嘅週年，全港首間官方Pokémon Centre將會開幕，選址又一城！11月會有一系列嘅週年慶祝活動，粉絲一定好期待！Pokémon Centre喺日本有22間分店，先後喺台北和新加坡開設海外店，店內有多款商品，包括經典公仔、卡牌、對戰周邊等，更有唔少係商店限定，以後使飛日本都買到啦！希望會有香港限定周邊啦！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696102220894790_1759514636a82dc7eb70f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696102402543858_2184285686a82dc808fa63.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696102578855791_7335805336a82dc8225497.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696102739481892_864822996a82dc83b3706.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T10:10:14.588156+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}